tion></figure><figure><img alt=\"如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260304/1105908480331747328794523.jpeg/dMQtwfwLMDt_n3ZYcvjpmwNd9_LdlH-QN71g5je9YOY\"/><figcaption>如何預防收到陌生轉帳（01製圖）</figcaption></figure><p>日本GU首位台籍店長！姊姊揪台人買爆 網相挺：肯定實力超強</p><p>阿嬤買甜不辣錢不夠…2客人搶幫付 店員一句話暖翻</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T08:15:39.579690+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1669,"images":31,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T08:00:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:51:55.576335+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T08:09:15.578829+00:00","content_hash":"1a6ab6ddbb29420e07316a9151082500b124aac8a17be5c40fc912632819711f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}